  'en',
  E'# Terms of Use\n\n_Last updated: publication date._\n\n> **Notice:** This text is an initial template and should be reviewed by a legal professional before production use.\n\n## 1. Acceptance of Terms\n\nBy creating an account or using the NEVVOH platform ("Service"), you ("User") fully agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.\n\n## 2. Service Description\n\nNEVVOH is a SaaS platform for managing tasks, teams, meetings, ideas, and knowledge, offered under a monthly per-seat subscription.\n\n## 3. Registration and Account\n\n- The User must provide truthful, complete, and up-to-date information.\n- The User is responsible for keeping their password confidential and for all activities performed under their account.\n- Accounts may be suspended in cases of misuse, fraud, or non-payment.\n\n## 4. Subscription and Payment\n\n- The Service is billed per seat (active user), with a minimum of 10 seats per administrator.\n- Free trial period of 14 days, no credit card required.\n- After the trial, continued use requires an active subscription.\n- Payment delays may result in suspension of access.\n\n## 5. Acceptable Use\n\nThe following are prohibited:\n- Using the Service for unlawful purposes.\n- Attempting to access other users'' data without authorization.\n- Performing reverse engineering, scraping, or attacks against the Service.\n- Submitting offensive, defamatory content or content that infringes third-party rights.\n\n## 6. Intellectual Property\n\n- The NEVVOH software, brand, design, and content are the exclusive property of the company.\n- Content generated by the User (tasks, attachments, ideas, etc.) remains their property. The User grants the platform a limited license to store and process such content as necessary for providing the Service.\n\n## 7. Limitation of Liability\n\nThe Service is provided "as is". The company is not liable for:\n- Data loss arising from improper use.\n- Outages caused by events beyond its control.\n- Lost profits or indirect damages.\n\n## 8. Cancellation\n\nThe User may cancel their subscription at any time. Access remains active until the end of the period already paid for. There are no prorated refunds.\n\n## 9. Changes to the Terms\n\nThe company may update these Terms at any time. Material changes will be communicated by email or on the platform.\n\n## 10. Jurisdiction\n\nThe courts of the company''s headquarters jurisdiction are elected to resolve any matters arising from these Terms.\n\n---\n\nQuestions? Contact us via the platform support.'
